    "body": "## Summary\n- add Flyway V31 and a durable private `user_blocks` relation with DB-level self/duplicate protection\n- expose authenticated idempotent block/unblock/list endpoints under `/user-blocks`\n- return only public target identity plus block timestamp\n- add a symmetric server-side `isInteractionBlocked` policy primitive for later chat/discovery enforcement\n- add unit coverage for create/idempotency/self-block/not-found/listing/bidirectional policy\n- document ownership, privacy and follow-up enforcement boundaries\n\n## Safety / privacy\n- block lists are private to the authenticated blocker\n- responses do not expose email, location, route, live tracking, payment or moderation data\n- self-blocking is rejected in service code and by a database constraint\n- repeated PUT/DELETE operations are idempotent\n- interaction policy is evaluated server-side and can be reused by chat/profile/discovery surfaces without trusting UI-only hiding\n\n## Validation\nRun Maven verify, Flyway/container runtime checks, frontend lint/build and existing smoke workflows. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
